# Power BI Report

This folder contains the Power BI report developed for the **World Population Age Analysis** project.

## Contents

- `World Population Age Analysis.pbix` – Power BI report file

## Dashboard Features

- Population by age group
- Population trends over time
- Country comparison
- Continent comparison
- Income group comparison
- Interactive slicers and filters

## Visualizations

The dashboard includes:

- Cards
- Bar charts
- Treemap
- Matrix
- Slicers
- Interactive cross-filtering
  
## Data Model

The report is based on a relational data model created from cleaned and transformed SQL data.

## Measures

The report includes DAX measures for:
- Average population by age group
- Countrows population by age group
